[ar: Bob Dylan]
[ti: Subterranean Homesick Blues]
[length: 02:16]

[00:09.05]Johnny’s in the basement mixin’ up the medicine
[00:12.37]I’m on the pavement thinkin’ about the government
[00:15.05]The man in the trench coat, bad job, laid off
[00:17.84]Says he’s got a bad cough, wants to get it paid off
[00:20.72]Look out, kid, it’s somethin’ you did
[00:23.19]God knows when, but you’re doin’ it again
[00:25.73]You better duck down the alleyway, lookin’ for a new friend
[00:28.68]The man in the coonskin cap in the big pen
[00:31.26]Wants eleven dollar bills, but you only got ten
[00:36.08]
[00:39.74]Maggie comes fleet foot, face full of black soot
[00:42.66]Talkin’ that the heat put plants in the bed but
[00:45.32]The phone’s tapped anyway, Maggie says that many say
[00:48.06]They must bust in early May, orders from the D.A.
[00:50.09]Look out, kid, don’t matter what you did
[00:53.63]Walk on your tiptoes, don’t try No Doz
[00:56.54]Better stay away from those that carry ’round a fire hose
[00:59.39]Keep a clean nose, watch the plainclothes
[01:01.93]You don’t need a weatherman to know which way the wind blows
[01:06.72]
[01:09.83]Ah, get sick, get well, hang around the inkwell
[01:12.91]Ring bell, hard to tell if anything is gonna sell
[01:15.86]Try hard, get barred, get back, write braille
[01:18.62]Get jailed, jump bail, join the army if you fail
[01:21.47]Look out, kid, you’re gonna get hit
[01:23.90]By losers, cheaters, six-time users
[01:26.72]Hangin’ ’round the theaters
[01:28.36]Girl by the whirlpool’s lookin’ for a new fool
[01:30.93]Don’t follow leaders, watch the parkin’ meters
[01:35.66]
[01:40.31]Oh, get born, keep warm, short pants, romance
[01:43.61]Learn to dance, get dressed, get blessed, try to be a success
[01:47.16]Please her, please him, buy gifts, don’t steal, don’t lift
[01:50.53]Twenty years of schoolin’ and they put you on the day shift
[01:53.33]Look out, kid, they keep it all hid
[01:55.75]Better jump down a manhole, light yourself a candle
[01:58.80]Don’t wear sandals, try to avoid the scandals
[02:01.89]Don’t want to be a bum, you better chew gum
[02:04.19]The pump don’t work ’cause the vandals took the handles
